Berikut kode lengkap file `p2.html`:

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Portofolio Mahasiswa TI UIR</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@700;900&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #0d0f14;
            --surface: #161a23;
            --card: #1e2330;
            --accent: #4f8ef7;
            --accent2: #a78bfa;
            --gold: #f0c040;
            --text: #e8eaf0;
            --muted: #8892a4;
            --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg);
            color: var(--text);
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 300;
            line-height: 1.7;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* ── HEADER ── */
        header {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            width: 100%;
            z-index: 100;
            background: rgba(13,15,20,0.85);
            backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding: 0 5vw;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            height: 64px;
        }

        header h1 {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent2));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
            letter-spacing: 0.02em;
        }

        nav ul {
            list-style: none;
            display: flex;
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        nav a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            position: relative;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        nav a::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -4px;
            left: 0;
            width: 0;
            height: 2px;
            background: var(--accent);
            border-radius: 2px;
            transition: width 0.3s;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: var(--text);
        }

        nav a:hover::after {
            width: 100%;
        }

        /* ── MAIN ── */
        main {
            padding-top: 64px;
        }

        /* ── HERO ── */
        #hero {
            min-height: 92vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 2.2rem;
            padding: 6rem 5vw 4rem;
            position: relative;
            text-align: center;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        #hero::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background:
                radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 50% at 50% 30%, rgba(79,142,247,0.12) 0%, transparent 70%),
                radial-gradient(ellipse 40% 35% at 80% 70%, rgba(167,139,250,0.10) 0%, transparent 60%);
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .profile-img {
            width: 150px;
            height: 150px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            object-fit: cover;
            border: 3px solid var(--accent);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px rgba(79,142,247,0.15), 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
            animation: fadeDown 0.8s ease both;
            background: var(--card);
        }

        .hero-text {
            animation: fadeUp 0.9s 0.2s ease both;
        }

        .hero-text h2 {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.2rem);
            font-weight: 900;
            line-height: 1.2;
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff 30%, var(--accent2));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
        }

        .hero-text p {
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.04em;
        }

        .hero-text p span {
            color: var(--gold);
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        /* ── SECTIONS ── */
        section, article {
            max-width: 820px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 5rem 5vw;
        }

        section + section,
        section + article,
        article + section {
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
        }

        h2 {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3.5vw, 2.2rem);
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            position: relative;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        h2::after {
            content: '';
            display: block;
            width: 40px;
            height: 3px;
            border-radius: 2px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), var(--accent2));
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
        }

        /* ── ABOUT ── */
        #about p {
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            color: #c5cad8;
            max-width: 680px;
            line-height: 1.85;
        }

        /* ── EDUCATION ── */
        #education p {
            font-size: 1.02rem;
            color: #c5cad8;
            max-width: 680px;
            line-height: 1.85;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            background: var(--card);
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        thead tr {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(79,142,247,0.2), rgba(167,139,250,0.15));
        }

        th {
            text-align: left;
            padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: var(--accent);
        }

        td {
            padding: 0.9rem 1.25rem;
            color: #c5cad8;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
        }

        tbody tr:hover {
            background: rgba(79,142,247,0.05);
            transition: background 0.2s;
        }

        /* ── CONTACT ── */
        #contact form {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 1.4rem;
            max-width: 600px;
        }

        .form-group {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }

        label {
            font-size: 0.88rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            color: var(--muted);
            letter-spacing: 0.04em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        input, textarea {
            background: var(--card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
            color: var(--text);
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.97rem;
            outline: none;
            transition: border-color 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
            resize: vertical;
        }

        input::placeholder, textarea::placeholder {
            color: var(--muted);
        }

        input:focus, textarea:focus {
            border-color: var(--accent);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(79,142,247,0.15);
        }

        button[type="submit"] {
            align-self: flex-start;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent2));
            color: #fff;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.97rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            cursor: pointer;
            letter-spacing: 0.04em;
            transition: opacity 0.3s, transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.3s;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(79,142,247,0.25);
        }

        button[type="submit"]:hover {
            opacity: 0.9;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(79,142,247,0.35);
        }

        button[type="submit"]:active {
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        /* ── FOOTER ── */
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 0.88rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.03em;
        }

        /* ── ANIMATIONS ── */
        @keyframes fadeDown {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-24px); }
            to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }

        @keyframes fadeUp {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px); }
            to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }

        /* ── RESPONSIVE ── */
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            header { padding: 0 4vw; }
            nav ul { gap: 1.2rem; }
            nav a  { font-size: 0.8rem; }
            section, article { padding: 4rem 4vw; }
            button[type="submit"] { align-self: stretch; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>Portofolio</h1>
        <nav>
            <ul>
                <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
                <li><a href="#education">Education</a></li>
                <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section id="hero">
            <img src="image/foto_profil.jpg" alt="Foto Profil" class="profile-img">
            <div class="hero-text">
                <h2>Halo, Saya M. Bagas</h2>
                <p>Informatics Engineering Student at UIR &nbsp;|&nbsp; <span>Angkatan 2024</span></p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <article id="about">
            <h2>Tentang Saya</h2>
            <p>Saya adalah mahasiswa Teknik Informatika yang memiliki ketertarikan pada bidang pemrograman dan pengembangan web. Saya sedang mempelajari berbagai teknologi seperti HTML, CSS, JavaScript, dan database. Melalui perkuliahan dan proyek yang saya kerjakan, saya terus mengembangkan kemampuan teknis, kreativitas, serta kemampuan pemecahan masalah untuk menghadapi tantangan di dunia teknologi informasi.</p>
        </article>

        <section id="education">
            <h2>Riwayat Pendidikan</h2>
            <p>Saya memulai pendidikan dasar di SD dan melanjutkan ke jenjang pendidikan menengah pertama. Setelah itu, saya menempuh pendidikan di SMA Negeri 1 BUNUT jurusan IPA pada tahun 2021–2024. Saat ini saya sedang melanjutkan pendidikan di Universitas Islam Riau (UIR) Program Studi Teknik Informatika sejak tahun 2024 hingga sekarang.</p>
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Tahun</th>
                        <th>Institusi</th>
                        <th>Jurusan</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td>2024 – Sekarang</td>
                        <td>Universitas Islam Riau</td>
                        <td>Teknik Informatika</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>2021 – 2024</td>
                        <td>SMA Negeri 1 Bunut</td>
                        <td>IPA</td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </section>

        <section id="contact">
            <h2>Hubungi Saya</h2>
            <form action="">
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="name">Nama Lengkap:</label>
                    <input type="text" id="name" placeholder="Masukkan nama lengkap anda" required>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="email">Email:</label>
                    <input type="email" id="email" placeholder="contoh@email.com" required>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="message">Pesan:</label>
                    <textarea id="message" rows="4" placeholder="Tulis pesan Anda di sini" required></textarea>
                </div>
                <button type="submit">Kirim Pesan</button>
            </form>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>©️ 2026 Teknik Informatika UIR. Disusun oleh Asisten Dosen.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
```

Simpan kode ini sebagai `p2.html`, lalu letakkan foto profil di folder `image/` dengan nama `foto_profil.jpg`. Buka file-nya langsung di browser, tidak perlu server tambahan.
